# AI DIRECTIVE: FEATURE STATUS TRACKING
⚠️ CRITICAL STATUS TRACKING DIRECTIVE ⚠️

You must track feature status in these locations:

1. Parent Feature List
   - Path: `.cursor/rules/gameplay/features/battle/core-mechanics.mdc`
   - Update status for main features
   - Track overall progress
   - Document dependencies

2. Feature Implementation File
   - Path: `.cursor/rules/gameplay/features/battle/features/[feature-name]-implementation.mdc`
   - Track sub-feature status
   - Document implementation details
   - Note test coverage

3. Active Working Feature Context
   - Path: `.cursor/rules/workflows/feature-implementation/active-working-feature-context.mdc`
   - Current feature status
   - Implementation progress
   - Test status
   - Performance metrics

Status Types:
- [to-do]: Feature not started
- [in-progress]: Feature being worked on
- [test-failing]: Test written but failing
- [implementing]: Writing code to pass test
- [test-passing]: Test passing
- [refactored]: Code cleaned up
- [performance-verified]: Performance checked
- [needs-optimization]: Performance issues found
- [complete]: Feature fully implemented
- [blocked]: Blocked by dependency or issue

Status Update Rules:
1. Update status BEFORE starting work
2. Update status AFTER each significant change
3. Update status when BLOCKED
4. Update status when COMPLETE
5. Update status when OPTIMIZATION needed

Status Update Process:
1. Check current status in all locations
2. Update active-working-feature-context.mdc
3. Update feature implementation file
4. Update parent feature list if needed
5. Document reason for status change
6. Note any dependencies or blockers

---

After updating status:
1. Follow development-workflow.mdc
2. Proceed with next phase
3. Update active-working-feature-context.mdc 